1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:06,580
THOX.ai Research has published a comprehensive technical report on ThoxWork,

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:10,260
our third platform, where people and named Digital Employees

3
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:13,650
share real work under rules a person can check.

4
00:00:14,901 --> 00:00:18,181
MeshGroups scope every request to one team,

5
00:00:18,201 --> 00:00:23,341
its approved workspaces and models, and an accountable human sponsor.

6
00:00:23,361 --> 00:00:25,481
Today the planner is a preview.

7
00:00:25,501 --> 00:00:28,951
It explains every denial, and it never executes.

8
00:00:30,077 --> 00:00:35,937
Before any external effect, work waits for a person when an approval reason holds.

9
00:00:35,957 --> 00:00:39,947
An agent cannot approve its own work, and every decision is recorded.

10
00:00:41,022 --> 00:00:43,922
Teams run tasks in order.

11
00:00:43,942 --> 00:00:46,982
Each Digital Employee leaves a written handoff,

12
00:00:47,002 --> 00:00:50,392
and the reviewer approves the result or sends it back.

13
00:00:51,370 --> 00:00:53,930
We measured what a record can prove.

14
00:00:53,950 --> 00:00:58,650
Hash links alone missed a cut tail and a rebuilt history in every trial.

15
00:00:58,670 --> 00:01:03,360
A session key and an anchor held by a second party caught both, every time.

16
00:01:04,735 --> 00:01:07,535
Read the paper, run the browser Evidence Lab,

17
00:01:07,555 --> 00:01:10,775
and check the rules yourself before you trust them.

18
00:01:10,795 --> 00:01:13,155
ThoxWork is coming soon.

19
00:01:13,175 --> 00:01:16,405
Your AI. Your Data. Your Rules.

